# Claude Code local setup

Copy this file to the gitignored `CLAUDE.md`, or run
`scripts/setup/bootstrap_dev_workspace.ps1`. The bootstrap preserves existing
local files unless you explicitly use `-Force`.

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for shared project guidance, then follow the task
route in [END_TO_END.md](docs/architecture/END_TO_END.md#find-the-existing-implementation).
Keep personal workflow notes below locally; do not copy the shared playbook.
See [developer workspace setup](docs/guides/DEV_WORKSPACE.md).

Tracked Claude skills in `.claude/skills/` include `verification-before-completion`,
`code-reviewer`, and `systematic-debugging`. Apply them when relevant.
